### Companies — admin + user (COMPLEX)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken =
@companyId =

### ── Admin: CRUD universal ──

### Listar com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buscar por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Criar empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Empresa Exemplo",
  "tradeName": "Exemplo LTDA",
  "cnpj": "11.222.333/0001-81",
  "contactEmail": "contato@exemplo.com",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Atualizar empresa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Empresa Exemplo Atualizada"
}

### Alterar status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/{{companyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "reason": "Aprovação manual"
}

### Desativar (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reativar
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/{{companyId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin — lista com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/list?page=1&limit=20&search=Exemplo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin — detalhe
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/detail/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin — estatísticas
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Métricas Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ── User: minha empresa ──

### Minha empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Atualizar minha empresa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/companies/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "website": "https://exemplo.com",
  "contactPhone": "11999999999"
}

### Dashboard da minha empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/companies/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
